---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Word Strata · Etymology Excavation"
	: "词层考古 · WORD STRATA";
const description = isEn
	? "Word Strata: Celebrating Anne Carson's 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature. An interactive etymology dig game excavating classical Greek roots through Latin detours down to archaic bedrock, featuring the Sweet-Bitter paradox meter and works showcase."
	: "词层考古 · WORD STRATA：致敬安妮·卡森（Anne Carson）荣获 2026 诺贝尔文学奖。交互式古希腊词源地堑探掘游戏——凿穿现代英语与拉丁泥土直抵古风希腊词根，玩转苦甜相依量表（Sweet-Bitter Meter）、生平时间线与经典书架。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0c11] text-zinc-100 border border-zinc-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-red-500/30 selection:text-red-200">
			<!-- Background Ambient Papyrus Texture & Classical Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-15 bg-[radial-gradient(#f59e0b_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-red-700/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-stone-700/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- 1. HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 text-red-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">★ 2026 诺贝尔文学奖 · ANNE CARSON 安妮·卡森</span>
							<span class="lang-en">★ 2026 NOBEL PRIZE IN LITERATURE · ANNE CARSON</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>📜</span>
							<span>ΕΤΥΜΟΛΟΓΙΑ · GLUKUPRIKON</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">2026-10-08 瑞典文学院于斯德哥尔摩宣布</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Announced 2026-10-08 by the Swedish Academy in Stockholm</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-serif">
					<span class="lang-zh">词层考古 · WORD STRATA</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Word Strata · Etymology Excavation</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">The Etymology Trench — 剥开词语的表皮，凿向古希腊词源基岩</span>
					<span class="lang-en">The Etymology Trench — Peeling the Skin of Words Down to Greek Bedrock</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							2026 年 10 月 8 日，瑞典文学院在斯德哥尔摩宣布，将 2026 年诺贝尔文学奖授予现年 76 岁的加拿大诗人兼古典学者<strong>安妮·卡森（Anne Carson）</strong>，表彰她“大胆而具独创性的作品，在与古典传统的生动对话中，为当代文学创造了全新形式”（"for her bold and inventive oeuvre that, in playful dialogue with the classical tradition, has created new forms for contemporary literature"）。奖金总计 1,200 万瑞典克朗（约合 120 万美元），卡森是该奖项 123 位文学得主中的第 19 位女性。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On October 8, 2026, the Swedish Academy in Stockholm awarded Canadian poet-classicist <strong>Anne Carson</strong> (age 76) the 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature "for her bold and inventive oeuvre that, in playful dialogue with the classical tradition, has created new forms for contemporary literature". Awarded 12 million Swedish kronor (~$1.2M), she becomes the 19th woman among 123 literature laureates.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							诺贝尔奖评委会主席安德斯·奥尔松（Anders Olsson）在颁奖词中指出，卡森的写作矗立于“<strong>文献学家对字词的痴迷与诗人对新意义的渴求之交汇处</strong>”（"the intersection between the philologist's obsession with words and the poet's desire for new meaning"）。当获知喜讯的跨洋电话打到冰岛时，自 2022 年起便持有冰岛国籍的卡森正站在荒原风中，轻声答道自己正“<strong>在听风声</strong>”。卡森视词源为一切思想与创作的发端，她的古希腊语翻译更被文坛公认为独立的艺术结晶。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Nobel committee chair Anders Olsson observed that her oeuvre sits at "<strong>the intersection between the philologist's obsession with words and the poet's desire for new meaning</strong>". When the Academy phoned Iceland—where Carson has held citizenship since 2022—she simply replied she was "<strong>listening to the wind</strong>". Carson calls the etymology of words the starting point of all her work, and her Classical Greek translations are celebrated worldwide as independent literary masterworks.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 2. MAIN INTERACTIVE: THE WORD TRENCH (词层地堑) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
							<span class="text-red-400 font-mono text-xl font-bold">01/</span>
							<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
								<span class="lang-zh">词层地堑 · The Word Trench</span>
								<span class="lang-en">The Word Trench · Excavation Game</span>
							</h2>
						</div>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400">
							<span class="lang-zh">点击地堑砖块逐层深挖：第 1 层现代语境 → 第 2 层拉丁或日耳曼迂回 → 第 3 层古希腊词源基岩与卡森典故。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Tap excavation tiles to dig down: Layer 1 Modern Soil → Layer 2 Latin/Germanic Detour → Layer 3 Greek Bedrock & Carson Fact.</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Progress Counter & Quick Actions -->
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
						<div class="bg-zinc-900/90 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-inner">
							<span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
								<span class="lang-zh">挖掘进度:</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Unearthed:</span>
							</span>
							<div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 font-mono">
								<span id="trench-counter" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-300">0</span>
								<span class="text-xs text-zinc-500">/ 8</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<button
							id="btn-excavate-all"
							type="button"
							class="px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-mono rounded-lg bg-red-950/60 hover:bg-red-900/80 text-red-200 border border-red-700/50 transition cursor-pointer"
						>
							<span class="lang-zh">一键全掘</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Dig All</span>
						</button>
						<button
							id="btn-reset-trench"
							type="button"
							class="px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-mono rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/60 transition cursor-pointer"
						>
							<span class="lang-zh">回填地层</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Reset</span>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- CELEBRATORY BANNER (Revealed at 8/8) -->
				<div
					id="trench-celebration"
					class="hidden mb-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-red-950/80 via-amber-950/70 to-stone-900/90 border border-amber-500/50 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.2)] animate-pulse"
				>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<span class="text-2xl">🏛️</span>
						<div class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
							<div class="font-bold text-amber-300 font-serif">
								<span class="lang-zh">地堑已全数贯通！8 个词根基岩破土而出</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Trench Fully Excavated! All 8 Archaic Roots Unearthed</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-zinc-300 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">你已凿穿现代语言的尘垢，触及古风抒情诗的火种。如卡森在冰岛所言，此刻在字词的空隙里，“你能听见风声”。</span>
								<span class="lang-en">You have penetrated centuries of linguistic sediment to touch archaic lyric fire. As Carson noted in Iceland, between word roots, "you can hear the wind."</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- 8 EXCAVATION TILES GRID -->
				<div id="trench-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
					<!-- Tile 1: night -->
					<div
						class="trench-tile group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800 p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 cursor-pointer select-none"
						data-word="night"
						data-depth="1"
					>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-amber-400">01 / TILE</span>
							<span class="trench-depth-pill text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400">
								L1 表层
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
							<span>night</span>
							<span class="trench-status-icon text-xs opacity-60">⛏️</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 1: Modern Soil -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-1 block text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-amber-300/90 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 1 · MODERN SURFACE</div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed">夜晚，落日与破晓间的暗影帷幕，沉睡与幽隐梦境的避难所。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed">Darkness between dusk and dawn; the veil of sleep and shadows.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 2: Latin/Germanic Detour -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-2 hidden text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-sky-400 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 2 · LATIN & GERMANIC</div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed">经由中古英语 <em>night</em> 与古英语 <em>niht</em>，平行同源于拉丁语 <em>nox</em>（夜之女神与阴翳）。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed">Middle English <em>night</em>, Old English <em>niht</em>, cognate with Latin <em>nox</em> (noctis).</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 3: Greek Bedrock -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-3 hidden text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-red-400 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 3 · GREEK BEDROCK</div>
							<div class="text-lg font-serif font-black text-amber-200">νύξ <span class="text-xs font-mono font-normal text-zinc-400">(nyx, gen. nyktos)</span></div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">古希腊神话中混沌（Chaos）所生的原始夜之女神，乘着乌木马车在白昼之前巡游天际。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">Primeval goddess born of Chaos whose dark chariot traverses the sky before daybreak.</p>
							<div class="p-2 rounded bg-red-950/40 border border-red-800/40 text-[11px] text-red-200 mt-2">
								<span class="lang-zh"><strong>卡森考掘：</strong>装置书《Nox》取名自该同源词；她以散落辞书卡片逐字解剖卡图卢斯 101 号挽歌，送别消逝在长夜里的哥哥。</span>
								<span class="lang-en"><strong>Carson Strata:</strong> Her 2010 box <em>Nox</em> derives from this root, anatomizing Catullus 101 to mourn her brother lost to the night.</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-zinc-800/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500">
							<span class="trench-action-hint">轻触继续向下挖掘</span>
							<span class="text-amber-400 font-bold trench-level-dots">● ○ ○</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Tile 2: desire -->
					<div
						class="trench-tile group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800 p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 cursor-pointer select-none"
						data-word="desire"
						data-depth="1"
					>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-amber-400">02 / TILE</span>
							<span class="trench-depth-pill text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400">
								L1 表层
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
							<span>desire</span>
							<span class="trench-status-icon text-xs opacity-60">⛏️</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 1 -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-1 block text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-amber-300/90 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 1 · MODERN SURFACE</div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed">欲望与爱恋，对那份悬空、未及之物的炽烈渴求与隐痛。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed">Longing, passionate wanting, the unbearable ache for what is distant.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 2 -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-2 hidden text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-sky-400 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 2 · LATIN DETOUR</div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed">源自盎格鲁-诺曼语 <em>desir</em>，拉丁语 <em>desiderare</em>（望星兴叹，<em>de-</em> 离开 + <em>sidus</em> 星宿）。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed">Via Anglo-Norman <em>desir</em>, Latin <em>desiderare</em> ("to await what the stars bring", from <em>sidus</em> "star").</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 3 -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-3 hidden text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-red-400 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 3 · GREEK BEDROCK</div>
							<div class="text-lg font-serif font-black text-amber-200">ἔρως / ἵμερος <span class="text-xs font-mono font-normal text-zinc-400">(eros / himeros)</span></div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">古希腊严辨渴望：<em>eros</em> 是穿透性的暴烈引力，<em>himeros</em> 是在场之欲，<em>pothos</em> 是对缺席之物的悬望。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">Greek nuance: <em>eros</em> is grasping passion, <em>himeros</em> yearning for the present, <em>pothos</em> longing for the absent.</p>
							<div class="p-2 rounded bg-red-950/40 border border-red-800/40 text-[11px] text-red-200 mt-2">
								<span class="lang-zh"><strong>卡森考掘：</strong>在《苦甜之爱》中，卡森画出著名的“三角形”：爱人、被爱者，以及横亘在两者间永难弥合的留白。没有这道缺口，欲望便不复存在。</span>
								<span class="lang-en"><strong>Carson Strata:</strong> In <em>Eros the Bittersweet</em>, she charts the geometric triangle: lover, beloved, and the unbridgeable space in-between.</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-zinc-800/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500">
							<span class="trench-action-hint">轻触继续向下挖掘</span>
							<span class="text-amber-400 font-bold trench-level-dots">● ○ ○</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Tile 3: sweet -->
					<div
						class="trench-tile group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800 p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 cursor-pointer select-none"
						data-word="sweet"
						data-depth="1"
					>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-amber-400">03 / TILE</span>
							<span class="trench-depth-pill text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400">
								L1 表层
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
							<span>sweet</span>
							<span class="trench-status-icon text-xs opacity-60">⛏️</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 1 -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-1 block text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-amber-300/90 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 1 · MODERN SURFACE</div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed">甜美悦口，蜜糖般的芳醇，令人沉醉的感官欢愉与抒情抚慰。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed">Pleasing to taste, honeyed, melodic, delightful tenderness.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 2 -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-2 hidden text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-sky-400 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 2 · GERMANIC & LATIN</div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed">经古英语 <em>swēte</em> 与原始日耳曼语 <em>swōtuz</em>，同源于拉丁语 <em>suavis</em>（甘饴、温润如初）。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed">From Old English <em>swēte</em>, Proto-Germanic <em>swōtuz</em>, cognate with Latin <em>suavis</em> ("sweet, agreeable").</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Layer 3 -->
						<div class="stratum stratum-3 hidden text-xs space-y-1 text-zinc-300">
							<div class="font-semibold text-red-400 font-mono text-[11px]">STRATUM 3 · GREEK BEDROCK</div>
							<div class="text-lg font-serif font-black text-amber-200">γλυκύς <span class="text-xs font-mono font-normal text-zinc-400">(glykys)</span></div>
							<p class="lang-zh leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">葡萄糖（glucose）词源，古希腊人不仅用来形容蜂房蜂蜜，更用来形容抒情诗乐的清甜韵脚。</p>
							<p class="lang-en leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">Root of glucose and glycerin; archaic verse used it for wild honey and lyric melodies alike.</p>
							<div class="p-2 rounded bg-red-950/40 border border-red-800/40 text-[11px] text-red-200 mt-2">
								<span class="lang-zh"><strong>卡森考掘：</strong>萨福首创复合词 <em>glukuprikon</em>（亦即 <em>glukupikron</em>，甘甜发苦）。卡森将其作为自己毕生文学审美的启动飞轮。</span>
								<span class="lang-en"><strong>Carson Strata:</strong> Sappho coined <em>glukuprikon</em> (sweet-bitter), which Carson established as the prime engine of her critical philosophy.</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-zinc-800/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500">
							<span class="trench-action-hint">轻触继续向下挖掘</span>
							<span class="text-amber-400 font-bold trench-level-dots">● ○ ○</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Tile 4: bitter -->
					<div
						class="trench-tile group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800 p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 cursor-pointer select-none"
						data-word="bitter"
						data-depth="1"
					>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-amber-400">04 / TILE</span>
							<span class="trench-depth-pill text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400">
								L1 表层
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
