						<div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">多伦多诞生 · Toronto Born</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Born in Toronto, Ontario</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">1950 年 6 月 21 日出生于加拿大多伦多。高中时代在当地二手书店偶遇古希腊抒情诗残卷，自此迷恋上希腊字母独特的书写节奏。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Born June 21, 1950 in Toronto. Enamored with archaic Greek lyric fragments found in secondhand bookstores as a schoolgirl.</span>
						</p>
