					<div class="relative group">
						<div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-zinc-950 group-hover:bg-amber-400 transition"></div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 mb-0.5">1968</div>
						<div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">多伦多大学与平面设计插曲 · Graphic Design Detour</span>
							<span class="lang-en">U of T & Graphic Design Detour</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">入读多伦多大学，期间曾短暂辍学进入商业设计领域尝试平面设计；这段关于留白、网格与视觉层次的训练，直接决定了她日后先锋“装置书籍”的装帧形态。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Enrolled at University of Toronto; briefly dropped out in 1968 to try graphic design. This visual sensitivity later shaped her collage-driven book designs.</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- 1981 -->
					<div class="relative group">
						<div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-zinc-950 group-hover:bg-amber-400 transition"></div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 mb-0.5">1981</div>
						<div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">古典学博士学位 · Classics PhD</span>
							<span class="lang-en">PhD in Classics at Toronto</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">在多伦多大学取得古典学博士学位（学士 1974，硕士 1975，博士 1981），专攻古希腊诗歌。其后受聘于麦吉尔大学、密歇根大学与普林斯顿大学任教。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Completed her PhD in Classics at U of T (BA 1974, MA 1975, PhD 1981), specializing in Greek poetry; subsequently taught at McGill, Michigan, and Princeton.</span>
