						<div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 mb-0.5">1986</div>
						<div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">出版《苦甜之爱》· Eros the Bittersweet</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Published Eros the Bittersweet</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">出版学术专著散文集《苦甜之爱》，围绕萨福的“glukuprikon”论证欲望在爱人、被爱者以及中间不可逾越的间隙中滋生，一举奠定其诗哲并蓄的文名。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Published her seminal essay analyzing erotic desire as a triangular geometry centered on Sappho's word <em>glukuprikon</em>.</span>
						</p>
