						<div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-red-400 mb-0.5">1998</div>
						<div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">出版《红的自传》· Autobiography of Red</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Published Autobiography of Red</span>
