						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">诗体小说《红的自传》轰动国际文坛。卡森重新翻译并改写古希腊诗人斯忒西霍罗斯的残卷，将红翅膀小巨怪革律翁重写为脆弱而敏感的现代主角。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Her verse novel recasting the winged red monster Geryon into an introverted modern boy obsessed with photography became an instant classic.</span>
