						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">推出手风琴折页装置书《Nox》。以卡图卢斯第 101 首挽歌为骨架逐词细拆，拼贴家庭旧照与信笺，纪念失联多年后猝然客死异乡的亲生兄长。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Published the facsimile accordion memorial box dissecting Catullus 101 alongside dictionary definitions to mourn her lost brother.</span>
