							<span class="lang-zh">借古希腊女诗人萨福创造的复合词 <em>glukuprikon</em>，深入探讨欲念如何在恋人与所爱之物间无法逾越的虚空中获得永生。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">An essay investigating desire that positions love precisely in the impassable rift between lover and beloved, anchored by Sappho’s word glukuprikon.</span>
