							<span class="lang-zh">以二十九幕探戈舞步的节奏推演婚姻破裂的全过程，在知识、欺瞒与美色迷恋的三重视角下审视亲密关系的解体。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">A verse narrative arranged in twenty-nine tango movements that anatomizes the slow unraveling of a marriage bound by aesthetic obsession and betrayal.</span>
