						<h3 class="text-base font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2">Nox</h3>
						<p class="text-xs text-zinc-300/90 leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">藏于硬匣之中的连续手风琴折页装置，将古罗马悼亡诗逐字词解与家庭拼贴融为一炉，丈量至亲猝然离世后的无言深渊。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">A facsimile epitaph in a box folding together dictionary glosses, photos, and Roman elegy to mourn the mysterious death of an estranged sibling.</span>
